{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Great Coffee Caper</strong> is a cute and cozy RPG where it's up to Detective Hootsworth to figure out who stole the town's coffee beans! Uncover clues in fast-paced clue battles, question the charming townsfolk, and figure out hoooo dunnit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882480/extras/39ae536c67b513542e7685e73507e107.poster.avif?t=1752764927\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882480/extras/39ae536c67b513542e7685e73507e107.apng?t=1752764927\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On a dark and stormy night, a terrifying fiend stole all of the coffee beans in the town! His tall top hat and spine-chilling roar are sure to send the nearest tortoise shivering in their shell! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Never fear, Detective Hootsworth is on the case!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover clues, question the charming townsfolk, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Catch the thief and solve the mystery in <strong>The Great Coffee Caper</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882480/extras/c419fac96e9aa5bef177b6097142d2f2.poster.avif?t=1752764927\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882480/extras/c419fac96e9aa5bef177b6097142d2f2.webm?t=1752764927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882480/extras/c419fac96e9aa5bef177b6097142d2f2.mp4?t=1752764927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882480/extras/67e9411ad5952ae7e5a6414bb0719fd8.poster.avif?t=1752764927\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882480/extras/67e9411ad5952ae7e5a6414bb0719fd8.apng?t=1752764927\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A cute, retro-inspired world to explore!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A cast of delightful and humorous townsfolk!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow trails with your spark glass!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast-paced clue battles! (akin to the bullet-hell genre)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">AND MORE!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;...hey! where's the stuff for &quot;AND MORE!&quot;?...&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;...what do you mean we can't show everything?!...&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;...ok fine! I will talk to the boss about it!...&quot;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882480/extras/c66ebe4a51681c327eeb187693c36d23.poster.avif?t=1752764927\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882480/extras/c66ebe4a51681c327eeb187693c36d23.webm?t=1752764927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882480/extras/c66ebe4a51681c327eeb187693c36d23.mp4?t=1752764927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3882480?t=1752764927","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882480/fdb998d5ef8ebafb60a2c54dae4bc3d3838e981a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752764927","capsule_